            "content": "{\"original_question\":\"I'm planning a weekend getaway and want to try something creatively fulfilling. What would you suggest?\",\"task\":{\"question\":\"What are the user's past creative or artistic hobbies, interests, or experiences?\",\"output_slot\":\"creative_history\",\"answer_type\":\"text\",\"inputs\":[],\"execution\":\"retrieval\"},\"grounded_subquestion\":\"What are the user's past creative or artistic hobbies, interests, or experiences?\",\"request_context\":{\"query_identity\":\"036f31159c29c791949c6100c26af170b449d981cfc6b626c060f969d2865ede\",\"algorithm_version\":\"dagbt_residual_memory_v2\",\"program_identity\":\"6b6e25052ad823dfda7c49aa8402642a12f7990cf5251210d7e1312b95c9fa61\",\"initial_dag_identity\":\"d6edebf88d5c8706563726ed96950d038b92e3a8946902a3b569ad20d6b10acf\"},\"variables\":{\"creative_history\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"demand\":\"creative_history\",\"scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"},\"evidence_semantics\":\"personal_history_summary\"}},\"requested_slots\":[\"creative_history\"],\"requested_scopes\":{\"creative_history\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"}},\"output_contract\":{\"mode\":\"semantic\",\"result_type\":\"text\",\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\",\"explanation\":\"semantic\"},\"program_revision\":0,\"rule_binding\":null,\"supported_parents\":{},\"known_observations\":[{\"id\":\"fact_1efc907b597744ee30c33308\",\"stance\":\"support\",\"value\":\"The user has a history of creative musical pursuits including remixing, original composition, and exploring music through genres, live performances, and personal projects. They have enjoyed remixing and experimenting with existing pieces, but decided to take a hiatus to focus on original compositions and personal projects to carve out space for their own artistic voice. They have also explored music through attending live performances, discovering album artwork and lyrics, and making playlists. They tried researching historical music trends in 2020 but found it tedious and overwhelming. They had a negative experience with a band collaboration due to artistic disagreements, which led them to seek more autonomy. They have expressed interest in composing original music and have reflected on the value of personal creation over passive consumption. They lost interest in music theory because it felt like a chore, preferring emotional connection to analytical components.\",\"source_ids\":[\"s36\",\"s4\",\"s37\",\"s16\",\"s17\",\"s29\",\"s18\",\"s46\",\"s45\",\"s27\",\"s5\",\"s19\",\"s15\",\"s7\",\"s3\",\"s28\",\"s6\"],\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\",\"parent_versions\":{},\"retract_ids\":[],\"reason\":\"The user's own statements across multiple conversations establish a rich history of creative musical engagement, including remixing, original composition, live music experiences, and personal projects, as well as negative experiences with music theory research, band collaboration, and a documentary. These are all past creative or artistic hobbies, interests, or experiences.\",\"variable\":\"creative_history\",\"revoked\":[],\"semantic_status\":\"model_judgment\"}],\"source_spans\":[[\"s3\",\"d1\",107,413,\"User: I announced a hiatus from remixing to concentrate on original compositions and personal projects because I felt the remixes were overshadowing my own work. This decision was not made lightly, as I enjoyed the creative process of remixing and the way it allowed me to experiment with existing pieces. \",\"user\",[173,174]],[\"s4\",\"d1\",413,797,\"However, as I delved deeper into my own musical identity, I realized that I need to carve out space for my voice to shine through in original compositions. Taking this time off is about redefining my artistic vision and ensuring that my personal projects receive the attention they deserve. Ultimately, I hope to return with fresh ideas and a clearer focus on who I am as an artist.\\n\\n\",\"user\",[173,174]],[\"s5\",\"d1\",797,1102,\"User: I'm committing to invest my time in the creation of original music, focusing on my unique sound rather than merely reinterpreting the pieces of other artists. This decision comes from a deep-rooted desire to express my thoughts and feelings in ways that truly resonate with my personal experiences. \",\"user\",[173,174]],[\"s6\",\"d1\",1102,1392,\"I've come to understand that original compositions allow for a more authentic exploration of my artistic vision. It's an exciting challenge for me, as I embark on this journey of self-discovery through sound and melody, ultimately aiming for a sense of fulfillment in my creative pursuits. \",\"user\",[173,174]],[\"s7\",\"d1\",1392,1515,\"I hope to not only develop my skills but also share my passion with the world in a way that reflects who I am as an artist.\",\"user\",[173,174]],[\"s15\",\"d2\",105,393,\"User: It was something I tried in 2020, but researching historical music trends felt tedious and uninspiring. Despite my initial enthusiasm, diving into the vast amounts of literature, videos, and academic papers often felt overwhelming, almost like searching for a needle in a haystack. \",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s16\",\"d2\",393,638,\"The more I tried to pinpoint what fascinated me, the more daunting it became, complicating the pursuit of enjoyable learning. Perhaps due to this overload of information, I lost sight of what initially drew me to the subject in the first place. \",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s17\",\"d2\",638,828,\"It made me realize that sometimes a less structured approach to exploration could be more fulfilling, allowing for genuine interest to emerge rather than adhering strictly to a curriculum.\\n\\n\",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s18\",\"d2\",828,1224,\"User: I realized that there are so many other ways for me to engage with music that align more with my interests, such as diving deeper into different genres or exploring the cultural significance behind various musical styles. Additionally, I've found that attending live performances, whether they are concerts or smaller gigs, allows me to truly feel the energy and connection with the music. \",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s19\",\"d2\",1224,1624,\"Moreover, there's something special about discovering album artwork, lyrics, and the stories behind the songs that really captivates my curiosity. I've also considered making playlists that reflect different moods or themes, which can create a unique listening experience each time. The journey through music feels more personal and fulfilling when I can connect it to my own life story and emotions.\",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s27\",\"d3\",107,356,\"User: After several disagreements over the artistic direction, I felt stifled, which really discouraged me from that collaborative process. It was as if the creative vision I had in mind was at odds with the direction my bandmates wanted to pursue. \",\"user\",[159]],[\"s28\",\"d3\",356,713,\"I remember those discussions often being emotionally charged, where opinions clashed and passion ran high, but ultimately, it was clear that I couldn't contribute to something that did not resonate with my artistic essence. Feeling restricted in that environment made me question not just my contributions, but also my abilities and instincts as an artist. \",\"user\",[159]],[\"s29\",\"d3\",713,896,\"This inner turmoil prompted a desire for more autonomy over my own creative endeavors, leading to a pivotal decision to explore my artistry in a more personal and independent setting.\",\"user\",[159]],[\"s36\",\"d4\",105,478,\"User: I left feeling unsatisfied, as though the film skimmed over the intricacies that make music a universal language. It was almost as if they focused too much on celebrity interviews and not enough on the artistic process itself. I found myself reflecting on how music has the power to unite diverse cultures and express emotions that words alone often fail to capture. \",\"user\",[43]],[\"s37\",\"d4\",478,845,\"The disappointment lingered as I thought about the many documentaries that delve into the creative journeys of musicians, revealing not just their triumphs but also their struggles and failures. It made me realize that true connection with music often comes from a deeper engagement, one that can be achieved through personal creation rather than passive consumption.\",\"user\",[43]],[\"s45\",\"d5\",105,482,\"User: I just lost interest halfway through and felt it was taking away the joy I find in music. There was a time when the thrill of discovering new melodies brought so much happiness, but diving too deep into the technical aspects became more of a chore. It’s curious how something that once brought joy can evolve into a source of stress when we start dissecting it too much. \",\"user\",[24]],[\"s46\",\"d5\",482,767,\"I remember the initial excitement of exploring different genres, each bringing a fresh perspective, but I struggled with the framework of music theory. Ultimately, I recognized that the essence of my love for music lay in its emotional connection rather than its analytical components.\",\"user\",[24]],[\"s51\",\"d6\",97,103,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s50\",\"d6\",0,97,\"Conversation message indices 3–4 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s52\",\"d6\",103,370,\"User: That was back in 2010. I remember feeling really excited about the whole process. It was such a wave of creativity! I still think about those late nights spent tweaking sounds and layering beats, capturing the essence of what I wanted to express through music. \",\"user\",[3]],[\"s53\",\"d6\",370,611,\"The thrill of sharing those creations with others is something I cherish deeply, as it fostered a sense of community among my friends. Looking back, it feels like a pivotal moment that sparked my passion for music production and digital art.\",\"user\",[3]],[\"s54\",\"d6\",611,624,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s55\",\"d6\",624,897,\"Assistant: That sounds amazing! Mixing creativity with technology can lead to some unique sounds. The fusion of various musical elements often results in innovative and fresh auditory experiences that can truly captivate listeners. Have you continued with digital remixes? \",\"assistant\",[4]],[\"s56\",\"d6\",897,1191,\"Exploring this world further can open doors to many exciting opportunities, as the music landscape constantly evolves with new trends and technology. It's so fulfilling to be part of a community where collaboration allows artists to push boundaries and inspire one another, wouldn't you agree? \",\"assistant\",[4]],[\"s57\",\"d6\",1191,1447,\"I’d love to hear more about any specific projects or genres you gravitated toward after your initial foray into digital remixing. Music has such a profound ability to connect us, and it's wonderful to share those moments with others who share your passion.\",\"assistant\",[4]],[\"s58\",\"d7\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 58–60 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s59\",\"d7\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s60\",\"d7\",105,447,\"User: Yes! I launched a podcast discussing the fusion of traditional and electronic music. This platform has allowed me to reach a wider audience and share my experiences authentically. By interviewing artists and enthusiasts, I can dive deep into their creative processes and discover how they incorporate various elements into their music. \",\"user\",[58,59]],[\"s61\",\"d7\",447,817,\"The feedback I’ve received has been overwhelmingly positive, with listeners appreciating the insights and stories shared. I also love being able to explore not just the music itself, but the cultural contexts that shape these genres and influence artists worldwide.\\n\\nUser: I realized that sharing my experiences could inspire others and even reignite my own creativity. \",\"user\",[58,59]],[\"s62\",\"d7\",817,1128,\"The process of putting my thoughts into words has helped clarify my own perspective. It’s surprising how reflecting on past experiences can lead to deeper insights about one’s journey. Additionally, I’ve noticed that when I articulate my thoughts, it motivates me to think critically about my creative process. \",\"user\",[58,59]],[\"s63\",\"d7\",1128,1266,\"This paradigm shift has not only invigorated my passion for music but also allowed me to connect with others who share similar sentiments.\",\"user\",[58,59]],[\"s64\",\"d7\",1266,1279,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s65\",\"d7\",1279,1630,\"Assistant: That’s a fantastic motivation! It's also a great way to connect with like-minded people. The exchange of ideas can often be a powerful catalyst for both personal and communal growth. Sharing your experiences could very well resonate with someone who needs encouragement on their own creative path. How have you found the experience so far? \",\"assistant\",[60]],[\"s66\",\"d7\",1630,2017,\"Have others reached out to you with their thoughts or experiences, potentially creating a vibrant dialogue? Engaging in such conversations can foster a supportive community that uplifts and inspires each member within it. It would be fascinating to hear about any discussions that have emerged from your reflections, as they can serve as a stepping stone to even more profound insights. \",\"assistant\",[60]],[\"s67\",\"d7\",2017,2136,\"Connecting with others in this manner can broaden your perspective significantly, offering new avenues for exploration.\",\"assistant\",[60]],[\"s68\",\"d8\",0,101,\"Conversation message indices 107–108 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s69\",\"d8\",101,107,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s70\",\"d8\",107,341,\"User: It’s become clear to me that I need to focus on what truly inspires me and aligns more with my interests, especially recognizing how vital it is to engage with topics and activities that evoke a sense of passion and enthusiasm. \",\"user\",[107]],[\"s71\",\"d8\",341,694,\"I have realized that my time and energy are precious commodities, and they should be spent on pursuits that not only enrich my knowledge but also bring me a profound sense of fulfillment. Diving deeper into interests that resonate with my core values feels necessary, rather than stretching myself thin over activities that don't spark joy or interest. \",\"user\",[107]],[\"s72\",\"d8\",694,951,\"This realization is quite liberating, as I can see a path ahead that is clearer and more authentic to who I truly am. It makes me think about how we all deserve to chase our passions instead of conforming to what society or external pressures might dictate.\",\"user\",[107]],[\"s73\",\"d8\",951,964,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s74\",\"d8\",964,1189,\"Assistant: It's truly commendable that you've taken this step back to reassess your priorities and focus on your authentic interests, as this kind of self-reflection is often the catalyst for meaningful change in one's life. \",\"assistant\",[108]],[\"s75\",\"d8\",1189,1550,\"When you align your pursuits with what inspires you, not only are you more likely to excel, but you also cultivate a sense of joy and enthusiasm that can be contagious to those around you. It’s fascinating to note how our passions can evolve over time, and sometimes what initially drew us in might not be the same as we uncover deeper layers of our interests. \",\"assistant\",[108]],[\"s76\",\"d8\",1550,1754,\"In choosing to prioritize personal inspiration, you're setting a precedent for a fulfilling journey that could lead to immense personal growth, satisfaction, and a greater connection with your true self. \",\"assistant\",[108]],[\"s77\",\"d8\",1754,2018,\"Take pride in this decision you’re making, as it reflects a deeper understanding of what you truly want out of your experiences and aspirations, and ultimately, such clarity can pave the way for incredible opportunities in both your personal and professional life.\",\"assistant\",[108]],[\"s78\",\"d9\",0,97,\"Conversation message indices 1–2 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s79\",\"d9\",97,103,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s80\",\"d9\",103,431,\"User: Hi there! I've recently been diving deeper into my passion for music and technology. It's been quite a journey since I started creating digital music remixes. Every aspect of this process has been fascinating, from selecting the right software to getting the nuances of mixing different sounds to create something unique. \",\"user\",[1]],[\"s81\",\"d9\",431,678,\"I often find myself lost in the intricacies of audio layers, where a subtle change can completely transform a track. Additionally, the way technology evolves continues to inspire me, as new tools emerge that enhance both creativity and efficiency.\",\"user\",[1]],[\"s82\",\"d9\",678,691,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s83\",\"d9\",691,1059,\"Assistant: That sounds absolutely incredible! Your enthusiasm for the interplay between music and technology is truly inspiring, and it's wonderful to hear about your journey into digital music remixing. With the rapid advancement of software and hardware, there are countless resources available today that can help you refine your skills and explore new techniques. \",\"assistant\",[2]],[\"s84\",\"d9\",1059,1382,\"For instance, you might want to consider diving into various digital audio workstations (DAWs) that cater specifically to different genres or styles of music production. Moreover, have you thought about collaborating with other musicians or finding online communities where you can share your remixes and receive feedback? \",\"assistant\",[2]],[\"s85\",\"d9\",1382,1686,\"Engaging with others who share your interests can deepen your understanding and even spark new ideas that you might not have considered on your own. The blending of creativity and technology truly opens up a vast realm of possibilities, and it's exciting to imagine where your journey will lead you next.\",\"assistant\",[2]],[\"s86\",\"d10\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 70–72 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s87\",\"d10\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s88\",\"d10\",105,388,\"User: Absolutely! After attending a hands-on workshop focused on integrating traditional sounds with digital techniques, I’m now enrolled in an audio production workshop. The workshop was eye-opening, providing insights into how to use technology to enhance traditional music forms. \",\"user\",[70,71]],[\"s89\",\"d10\",388,780,\"I’m excited about the audio production course because it promises to deepen my technical knowledge and skills, especially in mixing and mastering. This new set of skills will allow me to bring my creative vision to life in ways I never thought possible. I truly believe that this journey will not only elevate my music but also connect me more deeply with the traditions I'm learning about.\\n\\n\",\"user\",[70,71]],[\"s90\",\"d10\",780,1127,\"User: I found the practical aspects very exciting and relevant to my projects. Engaging in hands-on activities allows me to not only enhance my skills but also gain the confidence to experiment with different methods. It's invigorating to immerse myself in a learning environment where I can translate my imaginative ideas into tangible outcomes. \",\"user\",[70,71]],[\"s91\",\"d10\",1127,1386,\"This experience feels entirely different from the theoretical coursework, as it truly brings the subject to life. I believe this grounding in practical techniques will significantly impact my overall creative journey and foster a deeper connection to my work.\",\"user\",[70,71]],[\"s92\",\"d10\",1386,1399,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s93\",\"d10\",1399,1697,\"Assistant: That’s fantastic, Kanoa! It's wonderful to see how you've turned your interests around and are making the most of this unique opportunity. It's clear that you're harnessing your creative potential, which is crucial for any artist or producer aiming to carve their niche in the industry. \",\"assistant\",[72]],[\"s94\",\"d10\",1697,1972,\"The fact that you feel you're on a creative roll speaks volumes about your engagement and enthusiasm, as these feelings often drive innovation and personal growth. Embracing new skills and pushing boundaries can lead to incredible breakthroughs, so keep that momentum going! \",\"assistant\",[72]],[\"s95\",\"d10\",1972,2181,\"Your excitement about practical work will undoubtedly translate into a richer understanding of the intricacies involved in audio production, allowing for more informed and artistic decisions in your projects. \",\"assistant\",[72]],[\"s96\",\"d10\",2181,2468,\"Remember, every piece of knowledge you gather now will serve as a foundation for your future endeavors, and collaboration with others who share your passion can further enhance that experience. It's truly an inspiring journey you’re on, and I can't wait to hear more about your progress!\",\"assistant\",[72]],[\"s97\",\"d11\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 40–42 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s98\",\"d11\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s99\",\"d11\",105,430,\"User: I explored audio production techniques, but it just didn’t resonate with me, and I found myself tangled in technical details rather than embracing the creativity. I realized that while understanding the mechanics of sound is important, my true passion seems to lie more in experiencing music rather than dissecting it. \",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s100\",\"d11\",430,749,\"Despite my attempts to immerse myself in the production process, I came to feel it was more of a chore and less of the rewarding experience I had initially anticipated. I think I am more drawn to the emotional aspects of music, like the storytelling elements in lyrics or the feelings evoked by melodies and harmonies. \",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s101\",\"d11\",749,1006,\"Perhaps, I should focus my energy on areas that allow me to connect with music on a more emotional level.\\n\\nUser: It genuinely feels much better to focus on what truly inspires me, such as creating my own tracks, which bring me immense joy and satisfaction. \",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s102\",\"d11\",1006,1339,\"This process of creation allows me to express emotions and ideas that words sometimes fail to capture, acting as an outlet for my inner thoughts and feelings. Additionally, I find that crafting my own music provides me with a sense of accomplishment and personal growth, which is invaluable in a world often filled with uncertainty. \",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s103\",\"d11\",1339,1686,\"Music has a way of resonating with my soul, and every track I create becomes a piece of my identity and a reflection of my experiences. In contrast, when I watched a music documentary, it felt like something was missing, as it didn’t engage me in the way I had hoped, failing to evoke that same deep connection I feel when I compose my own pieces.\",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s104\",\"d11\",1686,1699,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s105\",\"d11\",1699,2074,\"Assistant: I completely understand where you're coming from, as focusing on your personal inspirations can lead to much more fulfilling creative experiences. When you channel your energy into producing music that resonates with you, it sets the stage for a more meaningful artistic journey, one where every note and beat are imbued with your unique perspective and emotions. \",\"assistant\",[42]],[\"s106\",\"d11\",2074,2413,\"The importance of self-expression through music cannot be overstated; it serves not only as a form of art but also as a therapeutic outlet. The reason documentaries can sometimes feel lacking is that they often offer an external perspective, stripping away the intimate connection that comes from creating something personally meaningful. \",\"assistant\",[42]],[\"s107\",\"d11\",2413,2670,\"While documentaries can provide insights and inspiration, they may not have the same emotional weight as hearing your own creations come to life, as they can't replicate the enriching experience of your own artistic journey and how it unfolds in real time. \",\"assistant\",[42]],[\"s108\",\"d11\",2670,2896,\"It's essential to honor that desire to create authentically, for it's in those moments of genuine expression that true artistry emerges, transforming mere sounds into something transcendent that can touch the hearts of others.\",\"assistant\",[42]],[\"s109\",\"d12\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 81–82 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s110\",\"d12\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s111\",\"d12\",105,344,\"User: It was a great way to blend my love for the outdoors with my musical creativity. The sounds of nature really added depth to the track, creating a rich tapestry of auditory experiences that transported listeners to serene landscapes. \",\"user\",[81]],[\"s112\",\"d12\",344,695,\"Moments spent in the woods, by riversides, or during rainy afternoons provided the perfect backdrop for inspiration, as I captured the essence of what it feels like to be in those environments. Each recording not only served as an instrument but also as a reminder of the memories tied to those places, enriching the emotional resonance of the music. \",\"user\",[81]],[\"s113\",\"d12\",695,817,\"This blending of natural elements with melody has truly rejuvenated my passion for creating and sharing music with others.\",\"user\",[81]],[\"s114\",\"d12\",817,830,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s115\",\"d12\",830,1178,\"Assistant: That sounds beautiful! Nature can inspire such unique musical elements, providing textures and layers that are often hard to replicate with traditional instruments alone. It’s fascinating how something as simple as the rustling of leaves or the chirping of birds can evoke powerful emotions and influence the direction of a composition. \",\"assistant\",[82]],[\"s116\",\"d12\",1178,1415,\"Have you thought about collaborating with other musicians on this? Working with others who share your passion for blending genres can lead to remarkable synergies, where each artist’s strengths complement one another in unexpected ways. \",\"assistant\",[82]],[\"s117\",\"d12\",1415,1777,\"Collaborations can also introduce you to new techniques, sounds, and ideas that could elevate your projects even further, especially in a band setting where different styles can creatively clash and harmonize. Plus, sharing your musical journey with others can lead to a richer experience, as you exchange not just sounds but stories behind every note and beat. \",\"assistant\",[82]]],\"required_scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"},\"rules_completion_required\":false,\"supported_task_outputs\":{},\"personal_response_selection\":true,\"phase\":\"history_evidence\",\"summary_revision_contracts\":{\"creative_history\":{\"previous_version\":1,\"eligible_route_ids\":[\"fact_1efc907b597744ee30c33308\"],\"required_source_ids\":[\"s36\",\"s4\",\"s37\",\"s16\",\"s17\",\"s29\",\"s18\",\"s46\",\"s45\",\"s27\",\"s5\",\"s19\",\"s15\",\"s7\",\"s3\",\"s28\",\"s6\"]}},\"repair_scope\":{\"failed\":[{\"variable\":\"creative_history\",\"id\":\"*\",\"feedback\":\"Provider explicitly truncated reasoning output\",\"observation\":null,\"slot\":null}],\"attempt\":1,\"previous_response_identity\":\"827b96d3114094a4d76485bcfcc0800c4d4c586aaccc2e56b73fd6ff2431b505\",\"invalid_response\":\"{\\n  \\\"slots\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"variable\\\": \\\"creative_history\\\",\\n      \\\"observations\\\": [\\n        {\\n          \\\"id\\\": \\\"fact_1efc907b597744ee30c33308\\\",\\n          \\\"stance\\\": \\\"support\\\",\\n          \\\"value\\\": \\\"The user has a history of creative musical pursuits including remixing, original composition, and exploring music through genres, live performances, and personal projects. They have enjoyed remixing and experimenting with existing pieces, but decided to take a hiatus to focus on original compositions and personal projects to carve out space for their own artistic voice. They have also explored music through attending live performances, discovering album artwork and lyrics, and making playlists. They tried researching historical music trends in 2020 but found it tedious and overwhelming. They had a negative experience with a band collaboration due to artistic disagreements, which led them to seek more autonomy. They have expressed interest in composing original music and have reflected on the value of personal creation over passive consumption. They lost interest in music theory because it felt like a chore, preferring emotional connection to analytical components.\\\",\\n          \\\"source_ids\\\": [\\\"s36\\\", \\\"s4\\\", \\\"s37\\\", \\\"s16\\\", \\\"s17\\\", \\\"s29\\\", \\\"s18\\\", \\\"s46\\\", \\\"s45\\\", \\\"s27\\\", \\\"s5\\\", \\\"s19\\\", \\\"s15\\\", \\\"s7\\\", \\\"s3\\\", \\\"s28\\\", \\\"s6\\\"],\\n          \\\"entity_scope\\\": \\\"user\\\",\\n          \\\"time_scope\\\": \\\"past\\\",\\n          \\\"parent_versions\\\": {},\\n          \\\"retract_ids\\\": [],\\n          \\\"reason\\\": \\\"The user's own statements across multiple conversations establish a rich history of creative musical engagement, including remixing, original composition, live music experiences, and personal projects, as well as negative experiences with music theory research, band collaboration, and a documentary. These are all past creative or artistic hobbies, interests, or experiences.\\\",\\n          \\\"summary_revision\\\": {\\n            \\\"supersedes_route_ids\\\": [\\\"fact_1efc907b597744ee30c33308\\\"],\\n            \\\"previous_version\\\": 1,\\n            \\\"reason\\\": \\\"Re-