            "content": "{\"original_question\":\"I'm planning a weekend getaway and want to try something creatively fulfilling. What would you suggest?\",\"task\":{\"question\":\"What are the user's past creative or artistic hobbies, interests, or experiences?\",\"output_slot\":\"creative_history\",\"answer_type\":\"text\",\"inputs\":[],\"execution\":\"retrieval\"},\"grounded_subquestion\":\"What are the user's past creative or artistic hobbies, interests, or experiences?\",\"request_context\":{\"query_identity\":\"036f31159c29c791949c6100c26af170b449d981cfc6b626c060f969d2865ede\",\"algorithm_version\":\"dagbt_residual_memory_v2\",\"program_identity\":\"6b6e25052ad823dfda7c49aa8402642a12f7990cf5251210d7e1312b95c9fa61\",\"initial_dag_identity\":\"d6edebf88d5c8706563726ed96950d038b92e3a8946902a3b569ad20d6b10acf\"},\"variables\":{\"creative_history\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"demand\":\"creative_history\",\"scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"},\"evidence_semantics\":\"personal_history_summary\"}},\"requested_slots\":[\"creative_history\"],\"requested_scopes\":{\"creative_history\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"}},\"output_contract\":{\"mode\":\"semantic\",\"result_type\":\"text\",\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\",\"explanation\":\"semantic\"},\"program_revision\":0,\"rule_binding\":null,\"supported_parents\":{},\"known_observations\":[{\"id\":\"fact_1efc907b597744ee30c33308\",\"stance\":\"support\",\"value\":\"The user has a history of creative musical pursuits including remixing, original composition, and exploring music through genres, live performances, and personal projects. They have enjoyed remixing and experimenting with existing pieces, but decided to take a hiatus to focus on original compositions and personal projects to carve out space for their own artistic voice. They have also explored music through attending live performances, discovering album artwork and lyrics, and making playlists. They tried researching historical music trends in 2020 but found it tedious and overwhelming. They had a negative experience with a band collaboration due to artistic disagreements, which led them to seek more autonomy. They have expressed interest in composing original music and have reflected on the value of personal creation over passive consumption. They lost interest in music theory because it felt like a chore, preferring emotional connection to analytical components.\",\"source_ids\":[\"s36\",\"s4\",\"s37\",\"s16\",\"s17\",\"s29\",\"s18\",\"s46\",\"s45\",\"s27\",\"s5\",\"s19\",\"s15\",\"s7\",\"s3\",\"s28\",\"s6\"],\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\",\"parent_versions\":{},\"retract_ids\":[],\"reason\":\"The user's own statements across multiple conversations establish a rich history of creative musical engagement, including remixing, original composition, live music experiences, and personal projects, as well as negative experiences with music theory research, band collaboration, and a documentary. These are all past creative or artistic hobbies, interests, or experiences.\",\"variable\":\"creative_history\",\"revoked\":[],\"semantic_status\":\"model_judgment\"}],\"source_spans\":[[\"s3\",\"d1\",107,413,\"User: I announced a hiatus from remixing to concentrate on original compositions and personal projects because I felt the remixes were overshadowing my own work. This decision was not made lightly, as I enjoyed the creative process of remixing and the way it allowed me to experiment with existing pieces. \",\"user\",[173,174]],[\"s4\",\"d1\",413,797,\"However, as I delved deeper into my own musical identity, I realized that I need to carve out space for my voice to shine through in original compositions. Taking this time off is about redefining my artistic vision and ensuring that my personal projects receive the attention they deserve. Ultimately, I hope to return with fresh ideas and a clearer focus on who I am as an artist.\\n\\n\",\"user\",[173,174]],[\"s5\",\"d1\",797,1102,\"User: I'm committing to invest my time in the creation of original music, focusing on my unique sound rather than merely reinterpreting the pieces of other artists. This decision comes from a deep-rooted desire to express my thoughts and feelings in ways that truly resonate with my personal experiences. \",\"user\",[173,174]],[\"s6\",\"d1\",1102,1392,\"I've come to understand that original compositions allow for a more authentic exploration of my artistic vision. It's an exciting challenge for me, as I embark on this journey of self-discovery through sound and melody, ultimately aiming for a sense of fulfillment in my creative pursuits. \",\"user\",[173,174]],[\"s7\",\"d1\",1392,1515,\"I hope to not only develop my skills but also share my passion with the world in a way that reflects who I am as an artist.\",\"user\",[173,174]],[\"s15\",\"d2\",105,393,\"User: It was something I tried in 2020, but researching historical music trends felt tedious and uninspiring. Despite my initial enthusiasm, diving into the vast amounts of literature, videos, and academic papers often felt overwhelming, almost like searching for a needle in a haystack. \",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s16\",\"d2\",393,638,\"The more I tried to pinpoint what fascinated me, the more daunting it became, complicating the pursuit of enjoyable learning. Perhaps due to this overload of information, I lost sight of what initially drew me to the subject in the first place. \",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s17\",\"d2\",638,828,\"It made me realize that sometimes a less structured approach to exploration could be more fulfilling, allowing for genuine interest to emerge rather than adhering strictly to a curriculum.\\n\\n\",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s18\",\"d2\",828,1224,\"User: I realized that there are so many other ways for me to engage with music that align more with my interests, such as diving deeper into different genres or exploring the cultural significance behind various musical styles. Additionally, I've found that attending live performances, whether they are concerts or smaller gigs, allows me to truly feel the energy and connection with the music. \",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s19\",\"d2\",1224,1624,\"Moreover, there's something special about discovering album artwork, lyrics, and the stories behind the songs that really captivates my curiosity. I've also considered making playlists that reflect different moods or themes, which can create a unique listening experience each time. The journey through music feels more personal and fulfilling when I can connect it to my own life story and emotions.\",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s27\",\"d3\",107,356,\"User: After several disagreements over the artistic direction, I felt stifled, which really discouraged me from that collaborative process. It was as if the creative vision I had in mind was at odds with the direction my bandmates wanted to pursue. \",\"user\",[159]],[\"s28\",\"d3\",356,713,\"I remember those discussions often being emotionally charged, where opinions clashed and passion ran high, but ultimately, it was clear that I couldn't contribute to something that did not resonate with my artistic essence. Feeling restricted in that environment made me question not just my contributions, but also my abilities and instincts as an artist. \",\"user\",[159]],[\"s29\",\"d3\",713,896,\"This inner turmoil prompted a desire for more autonomy over my own creative endeavors, leading to a pivotal decision to explore my artistry in a more personal and independent setting.\",\"user\",[159]],[\"s36\",\"d4\",105,478,\"User: I left feeling unsatisfied, as though the film skimmed over the intricacies that make music a universal language. It was almost as if they focused too much on celebrity interviews and not enough on the artistic process itself. I found myself reflecting on how music has the power to unite diverse cultures and express emotions that words alone often fail to capture. \",\"user\",[43]],[\"s37\",\"d4\",478,845,\"The disappointment lingered as I thought about the many documentaries that delve into the creative journeys of musicians, revealing not just their triumphs but also their struggles and failures. It made me realize that true connection with music often comes from a deeper engagement, one that can be achieved through personal creation rather than passive consumption.\",\"user\",[43]],[\"s45\",\"d5\",105,482,\"User: I just lost interest halfway through and felt it was taking away the joy I find in music. There was a time when the thrill of discovering new melodies brought so much happiness, but diving too deep into the technical aspects became more of a chore. It’s curious how something that once brought joy can evolve into a source of stress when we start dissecting it too much. \",\"user\",[24]],[\"s46\",\"d5\",482,767,\"I remember the initial excitement of exploring different genres, each bringing a fresh perspective, but I struggled with the framework of music theory. Ultimately, I recognized that the essence of my love for music lay in its emotional connection rather than its analytical components.\",\"user\",[24]],[\"s117\",\"d6\",1415,1777,\"Collaborations can also introduce you to new techniques, sounds, and ideas that could elevate your projects even further, especially in a band setting where different styles can creatively clash and harmonize. Plus, sharing your musical journey with others can lead to a richer experience, as you exchange not just sounds but stories behind every note and beat. \",\"assistant\",[82]],[\"s116\",\"d6\",1178,1415,\"Have you thought about collaborating with other musicians on this? Working with others who share your passion for blending genres can lead to remarkable synergies, where each artist’s strengths complement one another in unexpected ways. \",\"assistant\",[82]],[\"s118\",\"d6\",1777,1897,\"I would love to learn more about your experiences in these collaborations and how they impact your music-making process.\",\"assistant\",[82]]],\"required_scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"},\"rules_completion_required\":false,\"supported_task_outputs\":{},\"personal_response_selection\":true,\"phase\":\"history_evidence\",\"summary_revision_contracts\":{\"creative_history\":{\"previous_version\":1,\"eligible_route_ids\":[\"fact_1efc907b597744ee30c33308\"],\"required_source_ids\":[\"s36\",\"s4\",\"s37\",\"s16\",\"s17\",\"s29\",\"s18\",\"s46\",\"s45\",\"s27\",\"s5\",\"s19\",\"s15\",\"s7\",\"s3\",\"s28\",\"s6\"]}},\"source_documents\":{\"d1\":{\"doc_id\":\"personamem:memory:6d150ad4c535a7d1e56c49b3ef96bb96c6ad1180a0c11c38c79fd844a3c7550b\",\"time_metadata\":{\"observed_start\":173.0,\"observed_end\":175.0,\"event_start\":null,\"event_end\":null,\"validity\":\"unknown\",\"time_source\":\"message_index\"}},\"d2\":{\"doc_id\":\"personamem:memory:aaffd3d364a21d460342e7babd8b5457280c15990c4562f7265fb84a3ced558a\",\"time_metadata\":{\"observed_start\":37.0,\"observed_end\":39.0,\"event_start\":null,\"event_end\":null,\"validity\":\"unknown\",\"time_source\":\"message_index\"}},\"d3\":{\"doc_id\":\"personamem:memory:9dcc68cdc78aba6361e81893cb4c75797dcbb4404284522da9916f036582c37f\",\"time_metadata\":{\"observed_start\":159.0,\"observed_end\":160.0,\"event_start\":null,\"event_end\":null,\"validity\":\"unknown\",\"time_source\":\"message_index\"}},\"d4\":{\"doc_id\":\"personamem:memory:e7a026a1e699694225904ac735e54f242d28ca85da0c2e3ea86daf04d7e3237a\",\"time_metadata\":{\"observed_start\":43.0,\"observed_end\":44.0,\"event_start\":null,\"event_end\":null,\"validity\":\"unknown\",\"time_source\":\"message_index\"}},\"d5\":{\"doc_id\":\"personamem:memory:e7c973803319b0b032a23a834dfe4d7031c42cbaa315dba7d5243d255867dd55\",\"time_metadata\":{\"observed_start\":24.0,\"observed_end\":25.0,\"event_start\":null,\"event_end\":null,\"validity\":\"unknown\",\"time_source\":\"message_index\"}},\"d6\":{\"doc_id\":\"personamem:memory:356d57a5e9891b3e62a3f92b1f7b578d1b32ecd0e6d4edbcef7353797202c3c5\",\"